   "e76_probe_passes": 2,
   "e76_source": "there is no emulation path in the firmware, so the thirteen instructions have no per-instruction energy at all: a U-mode illegal instruction is delegated M->S and the exception handler calls return_from_kernel(KERNEL_RETURN_EXCEPTION), 758 instructions counted on the installed build, and that ends the hart's kernel. libgcc's __divsf3 (299 instructions) contains no trapping instruction, so a C float divide is safe and costs 310-570 multiply-adds; libm's sqrtf and fmodf and libgcc's __fixunssfdi do contain them, so sqrtf(x) is fatal",
